   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1: Project efficiency and sustainability enhanced. The facility will enhance the efficiency and sustainability of the
Moragolla project under the MFF by providing assistance for final operational tests, grid connection, project management and
supervisory support, and operation and maintenance including training during the initial operation phase of the Moragolla project
facilities.

Output 2: Project preparation and potential pilot projects to support renewable energy development and enabling private
sector participation. This activity will support project preparatory activities for developing renewable energy transmission and
distribution infrastructure, including for the transmission of renewable energy to be generated by pipeline private sector projects, to
load centers and for smooth integration of renewable energy into the power system. Potential pilot projects will include cross-sectoral
interventions such as solar photovoltaic systems to support desalination, interventions to identify technologies such as grid
connected energy storage, digital solutions, and renewable energy forecasting to facilitate renewable energy integration.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
